                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2ca3e3a-c66d-381e-b2a0-c9ce14e85b3a",
                        "entry_id": "4b3e2ca6-4aae-3d22-93a7-1f75816b9b3a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "snow-covered pool of water"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76441586-b0dc-4ae6-9fe1-ce3b662f2ae0",
                                "sense_id": "a2ca3e3a-c66d-381e-b2a0-c9ce14e85b3a",
                                "text": "Навстре́чу не́мца-до́ктора из Москвы́, кото́рого жда́ли ка́ждую мину́ту и за кото́рым была́ вы́слана подста́ва на большу́ю доро́гу, к поворо́ту на просёлок, бы́ли вы́сланы верховы́е с фонаря́ми, что́бы проводи́ть его́ по уха́бам и зажо́рам.",
                                "translation": "A relay of horses had been sent up the highroad to meet the German doctor from Moscow who was expected every moment, and men on horseback with lanterns were sent to the crossroads to guide him over the country road with its hollows and snow-covered pools of water.",
                                "english": "A relay of horses had been sent up the highroad to meet the German doctor from Moscow who was expected every moment, and men on horseback with lanterns were sent to the crossroads to guide him over the country road with its hollows and snow-covered pools of water."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
